                    we're all done, the pattern will look like:
                      set_number_at <jump count> <upper bound>
                      set_number_at <succeed_n count> <lower bound>
                      succeed_n <after jump addr> <succeed_n count>
                      <body of loop>
                      jump_n <succeed_n addr> <jump count>
